patch('F01','Frozen-deck independent-bank replicas, fixed-deck controls and convergence evidence distinguish sampling variability from systematic optimism; no bank B decision leakage.','Frozen-deck A/B1/B2 replicas, separate theta-position and latent-item controls, fixed-deck controls and convergence evidence distinguish sampling variability from systematic optimism; no evaluation-bank decision leakage.')
